  "texts": {
    "preamble": "S.Venkatachalam vs The State Of Tamil Nadu on 12 November, 2025 Author: A.D.Jagadish Chandira Bench: A.D.Jagadish Chandira In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 12.11.2025 Coram: The Hon'Ble Mr. Justice A.D.Jagadish Chandira Crl.O.P.No.30831 of 2025 and Crl.M.P.Nos.21113 & 21114 of 2025 S.Venkatachalam Vs. The State of Tamil Nadu, Represented by, The Food Safety Officer, (Code No.559), Coimbatore Corporation, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, O/o. Designated Officer Office, Coimbatore District, 219, Race Course Road, Coimbatore 641 018. ... Respondent Prayer: Criminal Original Petition is filed under Section 528 of Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita/Section 482 Cr.P.C., to call for the records pertaining to the complaint in S.T.C.No.3888 of 2017, on the fi the Judicial Magistrate No.II, Coimbatore and quash the same. 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ( Uploaded on: 25/11/2025 05:27:49 pm ) C S.Venkatachalam vs The State Of Tamil Nadu on 12 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/194612046/ 1 For Petitioner : Mr.N.Subbarayalu For Respondent : Mr.K.M.D.Muhilan Additional Public Prosecutor 2/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ( Uploaded on: 25/11/2025 05:27:49 pm ) Order",
    "facts": "The Food Safety Officer has filed a criminal complaint in S.T.C.No.3888 of 2017 before the learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Coimbatore, against the said restaurant and others, for the offences under Sections 59 and 63 of the Food Safety Standards Act, 2006. In the said complaint, the petitioner was also impleaded solely on the ground that he is one of the partners of Hotel Blue Star, where the alleged restaurant is functioning.",
    "arguments": "2. Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner, who is an octogenarian, is a partner of the lodging house, Hotel Blue Star, in which a restaurant was running in the name and style of Anu Restaurant, later renamed as The Buffet.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner, who is an octogenarian, is a partner of the lodging house, Hotel Blue Star, in which a restaurant was running in the name and style of Anu Restaurant, later renamed as The Buffet.",
